<title>USA: Emcore sets IPO price range at $9 to $11.</title>
<headline>Emcore sets IPO price range at $9 to $11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emcore Inc on Tuesday said it planned to raise about $25 million in its proposed initial public offering, according to a regulatory filing.</p>
<p>The Somerset, N.J., company plans to offer 2.5 million shares at between $9 and $11 each, the filing said.</p>
<p>The company had previously filed for an IPO but did not provide details about the number of shares or price range.</p>
<p>The offering is tentatively scheduled for the middle of March, according to lead underwriter Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette.</p>
<p>Emcore develops compound semiconductor materials.</p>
